        "notes": "Checks unglossed non-merge commits on the remote's branches and those being pushed, newer than the oldest glossed commit. Each check is remembered in .git/gloss-checked with the number of glossed commits at the time, and repeated once more glosses exist, since a commit's origins may be glossed later (tested). Carried glosses are then pushed like any other."
      },
      {
        "id": "versions",
        "intent": "`git gloss versions <commit>|wip` lists, shows and restores past glosses",
        "necessity": "required",
        "serves": "task",
